   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> webTMS </h3> <h2> »roboBox« user interface </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»The« »roboBox's« graphical user interface provides a clear overview of all available individual modules, including functions such as measuring, shrinking, and cooling. In addition, status displays are shown for each module, showing the current condition and progress of the robot’s running processes. These status displays allow users to effectively monitor the robot’s operation and identify potential problems in a timely manner.</p>",
